    <note>
      <content>
        <p>Best raw initialization improves utility by 0.0500296 and single-point HV by 0.0315288 over the first pool member.</p>
        <p>Against the original sequential raw search, the utility and single-point HV effects are 0.788952 and 0.486789.</p>
        <p>Both internal families have positive confidence limits, Holm significance and positive effects for all three seeds.</p>
        <p>The mechanism claim is limited to the frozen proxy-search contract and does not reverse the external actual-set result.</p>
        <p>Source: RK41 independent b402c4fd4899 · clean closeout af5ad2580151.</p>
        <p>Independent verification: 5,401 checks; clean closeout: 1,114 checks; full project tests: 494 passed, one skipped, five subtests passed.</p>
        <p>Coverage: 324 runs, 3,564 raw points, 216 complete new trajectories and 1,604 independently rescored unique sequences.</p>
        <p>Internal proxy improvements do not establish external SOTA, functional efficacy, protein OOD, untouched-confirmation success or manuscript-submittable status.</p>
      </content>
